            "value" : "Tier 2: Loads favicons from the selected provider (icons.duckduckgo.com or google.com/s2/favicons) and stores them encrypted in the merchant_logo_cache table. Only the merchant domain (e.g. lidl.de) is sent – no amounts, no account data. Default: off."
